The initial briefing told me that Rowan loves old sea shanties and follows cycling closely. During the session, Rowan shared the clue that Kofi and the Workshop researcher work consecutive shifts, and later shared the recovered clue that the botany researcher works earlier than Tomas. Rowan helped check the combined constraints and ultimately verified and submitted the final solution. Near the end, Rowan acknowledged and corrected a mistaken contradiction in their manual reasoning.

### Juniper
The initial briefing told me that Juniper’s favourite game is Pictionary, that Juniper spends spare time building model ships, and that Juniper’s favourite cake is tiramisu. During the session, Juniper shared the clue that Ines and the Lab researcher work consecutive shifts, followed by the recovered clue that Hydroponics corresponds to chemistry. Juniper independently found and submitted the final solution and helped confirm that it satisfied every clue.

