The initial briefing told me that Fir grew up in a mountain village and follows cricket closely. During the session, Fir shared the clue that Lena has either Hydroponics or robotics, but not both. Fir later explicitly shared the recovered clue that the Workshop researcher works at night. Fir also sent scratch-check messages, then clarified that some of their wording was not evidence or a valid deduction and should not be treated as a puzzle constraint. By the end, Fir had submitted the same verified final solution as the rest of us.

